                                "sense_id": "38460df4-d68e-337d-8573-9233027b85fc",
                                "text": "[…]rather to convince the Underſtanding, than to be eaſily capable of being anſwered ; excuſing your ſelf that you have ran into an Error, ſo foreign as you have declared from your Intention,[…]"
                            },
