                                "example_id": "355d719f-3ae2-4550-91db-3b306cc2ef8e",
                                "sense_id": "38460df4-d68e-337d-8573-9233027b85fc",
                                "text": "I’ve ran this event many times but in the year 2000, when we were running over the Bodmin Moor part of the course, it lashed down with large, freezing-cold hailstones."
